'Taylor Swift Napoleon Dynamite voices: at a 1 November 2026 Toy Story 5 screening, Swift revealed she and Abigail Anderson Berard still talk in Napoleon Dynamite voices — plus why she was in New York, not Denver, and what to watch next.',
